      "document_id": "4295",
      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "Senator Murkowski is advertising her introduction of legislation to change the Medicaid formula, and also highlights past funding ($34.11 million) she personally helped win. This demonstrates personal agency in authoring legislation and securing benefits."
